    "“%@” is holding secure keyboard input (e.g. a password field), so macOS blocks the dictation key everywhere. Close the password prompt or quit that app to release it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” holder secure keyboard input (fx et adgangskodefelt), så macOS blokerer dikteringstasten overalt. Luk adgangskodeprompten, eller afslut appen, for at frigive det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“App default” uses the model chosen under Intelligence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Appens standard” bruger modellen valgt under Intelligens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words Vara should get right": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ord Vara skal ramme rigtigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names, jargon, product terms, preferred spellings — one per line. Vara nudges the speech engine to spell these correctly (Groq, OpenAI GPT-4o Transcribe, ElevenLabs). ElevenLabs caps each entry at 20 characters and 50 entries; on-device WhisperKit and OpenAI Realtime ignore them for now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Navne, fagudtryk, produktnavne, foretrukne stavemåder — ét pr. linje. Vara skubber talemotoren mod at stave dem korrekt (Groq, OpenAI GPT-4o Transcribe, ElevenLabs). ElevenLabs tillader højst 20 tegn pr. udtryk og 50 udtryk i alt; lokal WhisperKit og OpenAI Realtime ignorerer dem indtil videre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom vocabulary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brugerdefineret ordforråd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Headset / close mic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Headset / tæt mikrofon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
